    }
  ],
  "notes": "Takes the particle に to mark the destination or target reached. More formal than {着|つ}く and emphasizes the culmination of a process or journey.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{目標|もくひょう}に{到達|とうたつ}する — to reach a goal\n・{山頂|さんちょう}に{到達|とうたつ}する — to reach the summit\n・{到達|とうたつ}{点|てん} — point reached, attainment level\n・{到達|とうたつ}{度|ど} — degree of attainment",
